# Environment & Secrets (Never commit secrets)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local Database & Test Data
# Contains the scrypt admin credential, user password hashes, live session
# tokens, customer names/phone numbers and per-order access tokens. The app
# recreates it from INITIAL_DATA (11 seed products) on first run, so no fixture
# is needed for a fresh clone.
data/db.json
data/*.json

